            "description": "Monitoring library\n==================\n\nLibrary contains several utility classes that help with building\nmonitoring scripts.\n\n-  *Worker*, synchronous, thread-backed worker processing tasks\n   (lambdas) inserted to the queue\n-  *AsyncWorker*, asynchronous worker processing coroutines enqueued to\n   the task queue\n-  *FiFoComm*, for client-server communication via named pipes (daemon\n   vs notifier comm), use JWT protection (not included)\n-  *TcpComm*, for client-server communication via TCP, use JWT\n   protection (not included)\n-  *NotifyEmail*, helper for sending notification emails via SMTP server\n   (gmail tested)\n-  *TelegramBot*, helper for sending notifications via Telegram, receive\n   messages, send messages\n",
